# Keep the Docker build context small and the image reproducible.
#
# Without this file the context includes node_modules (62 MB) and the local npm
# cache (65 MB), all of which is uploaded to the daemon and then thrown away,
# because the Dockerfile installs dependencies from the lockfile itself.

node_modules
.npm-cache
dist
coverage
data

# Never ship secrets or VCS history into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore

# Tests, docs and deploy templates are not needed to build or run the server.
# The Dockerfile itself is deliberately NOT excluded: some builders read it from
# the context, and excluding it is a classic self-inflicted build failure.
test
scripts
deploy
*.md
docker-compose.yml

# Editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
